<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bentley, Gerhardt & Bates (2008) PLoS Comput. Biol., Hellström et al. (2007) Nature & Jakobsson et al. (2010) Nat. Cell Biol. VEGF-VEGFR2-Dll4-Notch1 tip/stalk salt-and-pepper lateral inhibition and angiogenic sprouting, coupled to lumenized Poiseuille flow, wall-shear pruning and arteriovenous specification (Pass 3) — Model fidelity to source: 85/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Credited: the Brillouin k = pi stability verifier (L182-224), the M = 16 VEGFR2-Dll4-Notch1 + 2D sprouting solver (L245-483), and the new hemodynamic layer — an exact Poiseuille/Kirchhoff resistor solve (L773-845), the Pries set point tau_e(P) implemented as published (L641-662), log-sensing adaptation with metabolic stimulus and shrinkage bias plus topological pruning (L912-1198), a Notch -> lumen coupling point (L665-690), and the shear-only-shunt / uniform-shear / no-flow ablations (L1210-1240) whose outcomes match Pries 1998 and Chen 2012 qualitatively; five Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys) formalise the mechanisms. Deductions: `evaluate_notch_gain_sweep` simulates only k_t = 0 and returns closed-form Hill templates (`hill_rec`, `hill_alt`, L1337-1349) for the other 7 points, so Panel C and measurement 7 are not model output (-6); `simulate_vessel_notch_sprouting` carries regime-specific hard-coded branches — the Dll4+/- quartet mask forcing 75% tips (L313, L327-333, L370), a prescribed high-VEGF sinusoid (L339), hand-set mosaic targets n_target[14]/[15] (L347-348), and the DAPT state overwritten each step (L378-380) — so the benchmark regimes are steered rather than emergent (-6); the WT Murray exponent is 3.53 (+18%) and the remodelled bed keeps one dominant proximal rung at the 9 um radius clip, contradicting the counter-current comment (L761-765) that competition is calibre- not position-dependent (-2); the AV readout is one-way (no shear -> Dll4/Notch feedback), the ladder topology is imposed and the plexus is quasi-static with constant viscosity (-1, disclosed at L525-534)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2021-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch.py L1308–L1377: evaluate_notch_gain_sweep: only k_t = 0 calls the simulator; k_t > 0 uses closed-form Hill templates hill_rec / hill_alt (L1337-1349) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2021-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch.py#L1308-L1377>",
        "2021-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch.py L313–L380: Regime-specific hard-coded branches: is_dll4_haplo quartet mask (L313, L327-333), 0.78*d_target (L370), high-VEGF osc_drive sinusoid (L339), mosaic n_target[14]/[15] (L347-348), DAPT state forced each step (L378-380) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2021-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch.py#L313-L380>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-model-fidelity-2>,
